{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act37side_level_act37side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act37side",
  "stageId": "act37side_09",
  "title": "英雄的落幕",
  "storyCode": "GO-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da102eb7d5085e6fd93cbfe5e993dc6c6a22b10a00f29b99435e8739bbb5b79d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>城防军临时监禁室</><p=2>1098年12月25日 8:32 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——2区总算是打扫干净了，接下来就只剩下4区了。怎么样，当值的活不算轻松吧，要不要歇会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我打扫的速度可没比你慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倒是你，不必顾着我是感染者就故意让着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿。也不算吧，只是觉得你经历了这么多，总该会有点心累吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我还以为——呵，至于王冠那件事，我想得很明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一时冲动嘛！加上大伙有这个想法的可不在少数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过说起来，好像一夜之间，大伙都没那么害怕感染者了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是因为我们在伦蒂尼姆。议会和议长阁下颁布的政策，至少的确让许多人不再把恐惧和厌恶直接摆在脸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "照我一位哥伦比亚来的朋友所说，其他地方还是老样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不管怎么说，谢谢你帮忙打扫，不然队长又得罚我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我应该感谢你们并不限制我的活动，能做点事情也让我更心安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要我说，你完全不用担心议会的处理结果。不然，伦蒂尼姆这么多可以关你的地方，何必专门选城防军的禁闭室呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是冲着大伙不是老战友就是老熟人，能帮忙照顾你吗？放心，等过几天风头过了，随便找个借口你就能回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些还专门去议长办公室抗议的人才是真看不懂局势，维娜老大的为人我们还不清楚吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？不舒服吗？要不要先歇会儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说......议长会放了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，你就安安心心暂时在这避避风头吧。为了你那件事，外面现在可是沸沸扬扬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长不让给你收音机和报纸也是担心你知道了会瞎想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，要是你实在紧张的话，我那个因为贪酒经常被扔进来关禁闭的好兄弟在这藏了些好货。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我给你拿点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黛安苦笑着，试图聆听外面的声音。\n可除了水流通过管道的声音之外，她只能隐隐约约听到城防军操练的声音。\n在她被送进来之后，她与外面的一切联系几乎都被切断了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不知道埃利西奥先生是否一切还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真该提前和他说一声。他现在应该很担心我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "的确。他几乎找遍了所有自己认识的人为你求情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "议长阁下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很好，他们并没有像对待犯人一样对待你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也是您的安排吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。大伙自发的，他们认为你不该得到这样的判决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很多人为了你的事来找过我。你的朋友，我的朋友......还有我们共同的战友，甚至那些根本不认识你的市民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——黛安，我把那小子藏的好酒偷了一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他狠狠灌了一口酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "士兵尚未走到黛安与维娜的面前，就强行控制身体立定了。而他灌在嘴里的酒，吐也不是，吞也不是。\n他只好藏住手里的酒瓶，向维娜行了军礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别藏了，帕特尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我记得，号角小姐说过，军营里是禁酒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（吞下）咳——咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，维娜老大！可，这不是......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以不告诉号角小姐，但你也得替我保密我来见黛安的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有，酒放下，你不是给黛安准备的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......好吧。维娜老大，你专门来找黛安就是为了之后的安排吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就说你不用担心嘛，黛安！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勤快的守卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就先去打扫4区了。我今天可是老老实实执勤了一天，什么都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帕特尔留下的酒，你想先尝尝吗？闻起来不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黛安有些低落地摇了摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那介意我先来点吗？唉，和那些公爵开会，已经说得我口干舌燥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "议长阁下，您把我安排在这里，真的是为了要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们希望在老朋友身边，你会开心些。况且，你并不希望我那么做不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说实话，我没有你想象中那么坚决，我过去的生活，与你，与大多数的伦蒂尼姆人并无本质区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黛安，我的确犹豫过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，您这次来，是关于我的处置已经有了定论？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——我想，我必须亲自告诉你议会的决定，以及......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我应当与你告别，原联军第六纵队第十步兵团中尉黛安·韦伯，一位当之无愧的战争英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感谢你为我们的家乡做出的所有努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "议会吗......我知道了，议长阁下。什么时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你后悔过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许最后悔的事，是当初打完仗，没有马上脱下这身衣服，躲回诺伯特区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，您不会的，我了解您。推进之王不会放弃我们的家乡，伦蒂尼姆议长也放不下维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不后悔。维娜，我可以也这么称呼您吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们见过很多次，也并肩作战过很多次。但今天，恐怕才是我们真正算得上朋友的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜，在我走之前，可以陪我喝一杯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当时，你独自走进圣王会西部大堂后，所有人都觉得，从里面走出来的人将头戴王冠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“英雄终当加冕为王。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "贝克街上那家老书店里的每一本童话故事集，都一定有这么一个故事。那是我入伍前最爱去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也真心实意地渴望见证历史，维娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我让你失望了，让很多人失望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是的。你本可以成为一个好的君王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就因为我是一个愿意让伦蒂尼姆变得更好的人？那位被公开处死的国王难道不也想要让伦蒂尼姆，让维多利亚变得更好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可往往总是事与愿违。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有时，你的对，在另外一些人眼里却是错的。我也是最近才开始明白这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那应该怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也在寻找答案，黛安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一位我所信任的人告诉我，得试着接受憎恶我的人，并坚守自己所笃信的正义——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也还在学......可我从未想过这条路，会这么孤单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你醉了......维娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "维娜摇了摇头。她抽出了自己的剑，递到了黛安的手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还记得“诸王之息”吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "记得，是我从你手里接过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那一战后，它彻底不复锋芒，于是工匠们用最快的速度日夜不停将它重铸，并送给了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这把新的剑，更沉，承载的期许也更多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黛安，这柄剑每天都在提醒我，何为正确的方向——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......能确保维多利亚永远走在正确道路上的人，不是我，也不是议会，是你们。是每一个凭借自己的力量夺回我们家园的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......维娜，我还有最后一个疑惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当时，你在圣王会西部大堂里，到底经历了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你希望听到一个怎样的故事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一段会在贝克街老书屋流传的英雄童话，还是一段真实到乏味的真相？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黛安猛猛地灌了一口酒，摸了摸那柄冰冷的剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实，我更喜欢之前那把......握着她砍倒敌人时，我觉得那是我与维多利亚最亲密的时刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "入伍前平平淡淡生活的时候，我怎么也想不到会有这么奇怪的想法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，我也不剩什么时间去细细品味过去还没打仗时的平淡生活了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜，抱歉，我想，最后一点酒我不能留给你了。我很需要它——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哽咽）怎么都这时候了，我反倒开始怕死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛安",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哽咽）维娜，在我彻底醉倒之前，为我讲最后一个童话吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泪水顺着剑锋滑落。“滴答”，“滴答”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黛安......过去的故事你都清楚，那段童话最精彩的部分，你也曾亲历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但童话的结尾，你或许并不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那天，我走进了圣王会西部大堂，扯下了萨卡兹的旗帜，准备离开，却突然听到了王座厅里有人叫我的名字——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“亚历山德莉娜·维娜·维多利亚。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后我推开了那扇已经尘封了许久的门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我见到了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“我的父亲。阿利斯泰尔二世，他在对我说话。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的亚历山德莉娜，你终于回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维多利亚的女儿，到我身边来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "维娜看不清国王的面庞。\n金色的面具与他金色的头发融为一体，威严而不可捉摸。\n他，即维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的女儿，你在害怕我，害怕维多利亚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "维娜，永远不要向你的臣民展露出一丝一毫的恐惧。你的老师应当教过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你已经死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二十六年前，他们把你吊死在了绞刑架上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可笑，谁能杀死维多利亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些贪婪的羽鹫妄图从我的身上撕下肉来喂饱自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们甚至因为恐惧而设计谋害了自己的王，让他们更加方便在阿斯兰的领地上刨取食物和养分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可无人能杀死我们，公爵不行，红龙也不行。我们就是维多利亚的心脏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，这才是诸王长眠之所中你的雕像未曾完工的原因......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "公爵们根本没有安葬你，你一直都在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们只敢将我锁闭在这王座厅内，却不敢觊觎我的王座分毫。哈，懦弱的窃国者们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们害怕我的子民，害怕我的蒸汽骑士，他们害怕我们，维娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女儿，告诉我，我的子民是否还怀念我？我的骑士是否还拱卫着我们的王宫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......维多利亚人早已习惯了没有国王的日子。而你的骑士，他们都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死在维多利亚人自己的手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你呢，维娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......已经快忘记你的样貌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就走到我面前，摘下我的面具仔细看看......你只会看到你自己，亚历山德莉娜，我们都流淌着王室的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起，孩子，我没能实现我的诺言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本想将一个安宁且强大的维多利亚交到你的手中，如今却因为背叛而在这王座上枯坐了二十余年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我终于还是等到了你。孩子，接过我的权杖，戴上我的冠冕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "向我们的子民宣告，他们的国王回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扫清我们国土上的一切龃龉，惩戒背叛王室的所有懦夫。荣光不灭，维多利亚当如此！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "国王的权杖重重地砸在王座台上，沉闷的回响久久不绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......血脉从来都不是我们力量的来源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多么熟悉的话语，一如我在我父亲面前的狂言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，你还过于稚嫩，女儿，容我为你上这迟来的一课——“何为王权”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我赐予你反驳我的权力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿利斯泰尔二世",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亚历山德莉娜，回到我的身边，聆听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你已经死了，陛下。如今这些，都不过是你沉溺于帝国荣光的回响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我无需你赐予我任何权力，我也无需向你证明我信念的坚定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我只是希望你安息，父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "维娜握紧了手中锤，踏上台阶，走向了帝国最后的余晖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
